<h1 class="page-title">Refund Policy</h1>
<div style="line-height:1.8;">
<h3>Return Window</h3><p>Returns and refund requests are accepted within <strong>24 hours</strong> of delivery only.</p>
<h3>How to Request</h3><p>Go to your order details and click "Request Return/Replace". Provide a reason for the return.</p>
<h3>Refund Process</h3><p>Once approved, refunds are processed within <strong>5-7 business days</strong> to the original payment method. For COD orders, refunds are initiated via UPI transfer.</p>
<h3>Conditions</h3><p>Products must be in their original packaging. Opened or partially consumed items may not be eligible for full refund.</p>
<h3>Non-Refundable</h3><p>Delivery charges are non-refundable. Coupon discounts cannot be recredited.</p>
</div></div>
